cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use saurus-fsspec in your research, please cite the version you used."
title: "saurus-fsspec: an fsspec backend for streaming the SAURUS genomic surveillance database into pandas"
abstract: >-
  saurus-fsspec provides a saurus:// protocol for fsspec, allowing
  pandas, dask, and other fsspec consumers to stream the SAURUS
  Staphylococcus aureus database directly from saurus-db.org without
  installing the 15 MB CLI data bundle.
authors:
  - family-names: "Beckley"
    given-names: "Brown"
    email: "brownbeckley94@gmail.com"
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-12"
license: MIT
url: "https://pypi.org/project/saurus-fsspec/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/bbeckley-hub/saurus-fsspec"
keywords:
  - Staphylococcus aureus
  - fsspec
  - pandas
  - genomic surveillance
